Package: sparky-stereo-model-viewer
Architecture: amd64
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, libf3d3 (>= 3.5.0+dfsg-3+stereo3d4), sparky-stereo-mime-models, qml6-module-org-kde-kirigami, qml6-module-qtquick-controls, qml6-module-qtquick-dialogs, qml6-module-qtquick-layouts, qml6-module-qtquick-templates, kf6-breeze-icon-theme | breeze-icon-theme
Recommends: systemsettings
Description: Simple 3D model viewer in stereo
 A small window to open a 3D model, a point cloud, a splat or a CAD file,
 look at it and turn it. Built on libf3d; on a stereo display the 3D area is
 drawn once for each eye, with the depth the person set for the desktop.
